    description: Some("Pairs of symbol panels fall into a seven-wide well. Line three of a kind up — across, down or diagonally — and they fuse into a star, taking every other panel of that symbol on the board with them. Seven stars in a row hatch a fairy, who carries the stars above her out through the top; empty the board to clear the round."),
